-    result: passed|failed|skipped
-evidence: []
-verdict: passed|failed|needs-environment
-failure_class: none|implementation|requirement|environment|permission|data
-```
-
-## Remediation
-
-```yaml
-remediation_id: REM-###
-unit_id: UNIT-001
-attempt: 1
-defect: "复核或测试观察到的问题"
-root_cause_hypothesis: ""
-change_made: ""
